   f. Use the Software in any way that breaks the law.

4. Community edition limits

   The Community edition is free forever. It is limited to one engineer per
   installation and to the usage limits published at
   https://www.nool.dev/pricing (1,000 knots a month at the date of this
   licence). The Software enforces these limits and tells you when you reach
   them.

5. Team and Enterprise editions

   The Team and Enterprise editions are not covered by this licence. They are
   licensed under separate commercial terms at https://www.nool.dev/terms,
   with pricing at https://www.nool.dev/pricing. Enterprise contracts include
