7. Telemetry

   The Software can send anonymous, optional usage telemetry: Nool version,
   operating system and architecture, command name, success and a coarse
   duration bucket. It never sends source code, file paths, repository data,
   user names or IP addresses. `nool telemetry show` prints exactly what is
   sent; `nool telemetry disable` switches it off without affecting this
   licence.

